da goi ko'a puzi ninzba lo papri ne'i le .uitki .i da ninzba lo sampli beme'e 
zo .dzacom. mu'a .ibabo ko'a ninzba lo papri beme'e zoi .ly. 
UserPagedzacom .ly. i zvati loi vrici me la .ipyvon. judri noi ku'i kuspe 
lu'o re de .i le drata se kuspe cu zvati la .gosport*.ritygug. i le se drata 
cu zvati la .moskov. i mi ka'e vimcu lo papri .iku'i na djuno lo du'u zukte 
makau poi drata

*"Gosport" was a word many years ago in a Fictionary game I'm in. It means a 
tube used to communicate between separate cockpits of an airplane, and was 
named for the place in England, for reasons totally unobvious if you've never 
heard of a gosport before, which of course no one but the wordpicker had. 
IIRR it was the word before "murnival", in which round I joined.

mu'omi'e .pier.
